__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Raw guest output and fixtures stay outside the repository; committed evidence is
# RESULT LINES plus an inputs.json, which is what CLAUDE.md asks for ("commit
# result lines, not the capture they came from") and what the other fifteen
# corpora in this tree already do. This file previously ignored results/
# outright, which made this the ONE corpus with no committed evidence and is
# what cheribsd-denominator-audit.md flagged against it.
results/*/guest/
results/*/fixtures/
results/*/raw/
